   {
    "caption": "EXCLUSIVE: Leave a “YES” below and I’ll DM you the full episode with @collingosselin1👇 Colin is shareing his story like never before on On Purpose 🎙️\n\nMillions of people watched Colin grow up on Jon & Kate Plus 8. But what the cameras captured was only one version of his childhood. For the first time, Colin shares his account of what was happening behind the scenes—including childhood abuse, isolation, being institutionalized at 11 years old, and the years he spent trying to reclaim his life.\n\nWe talk about growing up without privacy, feeling unable to ask for help, being separated from his siblings, rebuilding his relationship with his dad, and the lasting impact of having your most formative years turned into entertainment for millions of people.\n\nWhat stayed with me most was the purpose Colin has found through everything he’s experienced. Rather than allowing his past to define his future, he’s determined to use his story to advocate for children who may not have the ability or opportunity to speak for themselves.\n\nIf you’ve ever felt unheard, struggled to heal from your childhood, had to rebuild trust after being hurt, or wondered how to turn the most painful parts of your story into something meaningful… I hope this conversation reminds you that your past doesn’t have to decide who you become.\n\n🎧 Video available on Netflix or Spotify by searching “On Purpose with Colin Gosselin” or listen wherever you get your podcasts // LINK IN BIO",
